  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">波の轟音と奇岩に抱かれる神秘の非日常体験！日本の洞窟温泉特集</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">天然の岩窟内に湧き出る「洞窟温泉（どうくつおんせん）」は、地球の鼓動をダイレクトに肌で感じる究極の秘湯体験。岩壁に反響する湯の音や、洞窟の向こうに広がる大海原の絶景は一度入れば一生忘れられないインパクトを残します。</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🌊 一度は訪れたい日本屈指の洞窟温泉名宿</h3>\n<ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside bg-amber-50/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-200\">\n  <li><strong>和歌山・南紀勝浦温泉「ホテル浦島」忘帰洞・玄武洞：</strong>太平洋の荒波が打ち寄せる巨大な天然海食洞の中に作られた大浴場。「帰るのを忘れるほど心地よい」と讃えられた名湯中の名湯。</li>\n  <li><strong>熊本・黒川温泉「新明館」洞窟風呂：</strong>初代館主がノミと金槌で10年かけて掘り進めた手掘りの洞窟温泉。幻想的な灯りとほのかな硫黄の香りが旅情をかき立てます。</li>\n  <li><strong>静岡・堂ヶ島温泉：</strong>西伊豆の奇岩と駿河湾の夕陽を一望できる洞窟風岩風呂。波打ち際のダイナミックな湯浴みが魅力です。</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設（追加セレクション）</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/6002/6002.jpg\" alt=\"南紀勝浦温泉　ホテルなぎさや\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">南紀勝浦温泉　ホテルなぎさや</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">和歌山県東牟婁郡那智勝浦町大字湯川955番地の1 ｜ JR「紀伊勝浦駅」より車で約5分（事前予約で送迎サービス有）／大阪から紀勢自動車道「すさみ南IC」経由で約3時間半</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.03（648件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥8,800〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">トンネルを抜けるとそこは…映画のような入り江の中にある秘密のお宿</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D6002\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/75227/75227.jpg\" alt=\"勝浦温泉　休暇村　南紀勝浦\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">勝浦温泉　休暇村　南紀勝浦</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">和歌山県東牟婁郡那智勝浦町宇久井719 ｜ 送迎バス（要予約）</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.38（628件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥11,000〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">熊野灘の潮騒と朝陽に癒される高台のリゾートホテル</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D75227\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/54556/54556.jpg\" alt=\"南紀勝浦温泉　ホテル浦島\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">南紀勝浦温泉　ホテル浦島</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">和歌山県東牟婁郡那智勝浦町勝浦1165-2 ｜ ＪＲ紀勢線　紀伊勝浦駅から徒歩6分で桟橋へ。更に専用ボート又は、シャトルバスで５分　詳しくは交通案内ページをご覧ください</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.21（6304件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥8,250〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">【楽天トラベルゴールドアワード受賞】圧倒的なスケールと開放感！天然洞窟温泉など湯巡りを楽しもう♪</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D54556\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/68247/68247.jpg\" alt=\"南紀勝浦温泉　くつろぎの宿　料理旅館　万清楼\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">南紀勝浦温泉　くつろぎの宿　料理旅館　万清楼</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">和歌山県東牟婁郡那智勝浦町勝浦448 ｜ JR「紀伊勝浦駅」より徒歩約7分／大阪から紀勢自動車道「すさみ南IC」経由で約3時間半</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.4（823件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥14,410〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">【ホテル浦島の温泉も利用可】紀州勝浦産の生まぐろや南紀の食材を使った会席料理をお楽しみください。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D68247\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/107899/107899.jpg\" alt=\"ＴＡＯＹＡ那智勝浦\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">ＴＡＯＹＡ那智勝浦</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">和歌山県東牟婁郡那智勝浦町湯川1108 ｜ 紀伊勝浦駅よりお車にて２分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.31（1445件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥15,800〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">海に囲まれた和モダンを感じるラウンジでオールインクルーシブ体験をご堪能ください。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D107899\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/7832/7832.jpg\" alt=\"パルスイン勝浦\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">パルスイン勝浦</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">和歌山県東牟婁郡那智勝浦町天満字木戸浦441-38 ｜ JR「紀伊天満駅」より徒歩約3分／JR「紀伊勝浦駅」より車で約3分／大阪から紀勢自動車道「すさみ南IC」経由で約3時間半</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 2.82（682件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥5,500〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">ご宿泊のお客様は、姉妹館の露天風呂・大浴場、提携旅館の温泉を無料でご利用いただけます。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D7832\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/145078/145078.jpg\" alt=\"Ｈｏｔｅｌ　＆　Ｒｅｎｔａ　Ｃａｒ　６６０\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">Ｈｏｔｅｌ　＆　Ｒｅｎｔａ　Ｃａｒ　６６０</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">和歌山県東牟婁郡那智勝浦町朝日3-7-1 ｜ 紀伊勝浦駅より徒歩にて２分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.06（1434件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥3,780〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">温泉大浴場あり！フロントでオリジナルレンタカー貸出ＯＫ！レジャーやビジネスにとても便利なホテルです♪</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D145078\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n    ♨️ 【公式楽天トラベル】大迫力の洞窟風呂・絶景秘湯宿を予約する\n  </a>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🌊 東海・関西・九州の注目「洞窟温泉」比較</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-3 text-xs text-stone-700 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-amber-50/60 rounded-xl border border-amber-200\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-amber-950 text-sm mb-1\">1. 和歌山県 南紀勝浦温泉「ホテル浦島（大洞窟風呂 忘帰洞）」</h4>\n    <p>太平洋の荒波が打ち寄せる巨大な天然海蝕洞窟の中に湧く名湯。「帰るのを忘れるほど心地よい」と称された絶景風呂は圧巻の一言です。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-amber-50/60 rounded-xl border border-amber-200\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-amber-950 text-sm mb-1\">2. 熊本県 黒川温泉「新明館（手掘り洞窟風呂）」</h4>\n    <p>館主が10年の歳月をかけてノミとツルハシで掘り進めた全長30mの神秘的洞窟。ほの暗い灯りと心地よい湯音が非日常へと誘います。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-amber-50/60 rounded-xl border border-amber-200\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-amber-950 text-sm mb-1\">3. 静岡県・伊豆／東海エリアの海浜洞窟温泉</h4>\n    <p>伊豆半島の海岸線沿いにも、波の浸食によってできた洞窟露天風呂が点在。波音と硫黄の香りに包まれる極上リトリートです。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-4 bg-amber-50/60 rounded-xl border border-amber-200\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xs text-amber-950 mb-2\">📌 テーマ別・特化詳細ガイド</h4>\n  <ul class=\"text-xs text-amber-900 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside\">\n    <li><a href=\"/posts/nachikatsuura-urashima-bokido-cave-bath-guide\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700 font-medium\">【南紀勝浦】ホテル浦島「大洞窟風呂 忘帰洞」完全宿泊ルポ！海蝕洞窟の絶景温泉と生マグロ会席</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n"
